              "node": {
                "text": "38K likes, 246 comments - mediterraneandietrecipes_ on June 18, 2026: \"DASH Sweet Potato Crostini with Avocado, Feta & Tomatoes\nIngredients\n1 large sweet potato, sliced into ½-inch rounds\n1 tbsp olive oil\n1 ripe avocado, diced\n½ cup cherry tomatoes, halved\n¼ cup reduced-fat feta cheese, crumbled\n2 tbsp finely diced red onion\n1 tbsp fresh parsley or cilantro, chopped\n1 tsp balsamic glaze (optional)\nSalt and black pepper, to taste\nInstructions\nPreheat oven to 400°F (200°C).\nBrush sweet potato slices with olive oil and roast for 20–25 minutes, flipping halfway, until tender.\nIn a bowl, combine avocado, cherry tomatoes, red onion, and herbs.\nTop each roasted sweet potato slice with the avocado mixture and sprinkle with feta cheese.\nDrizzle with balsamic glaze, season lightly with salt and pepper, and serve.\". "
